# ── Twilio SMS (Optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave these blank to run in MOCK MODE (safe for local dev & portfolio demos).
# Fill them in with real Twilio credentials to send actual text messages.
#
# Get your keys at: https://console.twilio.com
#   TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID  → "Account SID"   on the Twilio Console homepage
#   TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN   → "Auth Token"     on the Twilio Console homepage
#   TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER → Your Twilio phone number in E.164 format (+1XXXXXXXXXX)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=
